Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Plutonium: the shell pairs with the launcher's token
 only if it isn't paired yet

The launcher offers a one-time token as #plutoniumPair= on every start. It
becomes T3's #token= only when the browser isn't paired, so a paired profile
doesn't add a session each time.
